 with his left hand and making smaller, more precise gestures with his right hand — possibly to emphasize specific data points now visible in the zoomed-in view.\n\n---\n\n**Summary of cursor interaction:**\n\n- The mouse cursor begins hovering over “Price” values (Frames 2–5).\n- It then focuses on the “78.88” price in Frame 6.\n- Finally, in Frame 11, it moves to and highlights the “To” column entry “gayvee.eth,” indicating a shift in narrative focus from transaction value to transaction recipient.\n\nThis sequence suggests the narrator is guiding the viewer’s attention through the sale data — first broadly, then to specific prices, and finally to the identity of the buyer."}], 'formatted_responses': ["\n=== Batch 0-11 (11 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0205.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0206.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0207.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0208.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0209.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0210.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0211.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0212.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0213.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0214.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/Pm93D8CVlY8/frames/frame_0215.jpg\nVLM Response: Based on the 11 frames provided, here is a specific description of the requested elements:\n\n---\n\n**1) The man's right hand position and movements:**\n\n- In **Frame 1**, the man’s right hand is raised, palm open, gesturing toward the screen as if explaining or presenting the data.\n- In **Frames 2–5**, his right